OL,3,GNEWSAOld Trafford travel delay warning
OL,4,Aas trams off
OL,5,
OL,6,FFootball fans travelling to Manchester
OL,7,Flater have been warned of disruptions
OL,8,Fto their journey due to tram
OL,9,Fcancellations.
OL,11,FThousands of fans are set to arrive at
OL,12,FManchester United's Old Trafford
OL,13,Fstadium later ahead of the club's
OL,14,Ffixture against Bournemouth FC at 14:00
OL,15,FGMT.
OL,17,FBut due to improvement works, there
OL,18,Fwill be no trams operating on the
OL,19,FAltrincham, Trafford Park and Eccles
OL,20,Flines and services on the Airport and
OL,21,FEast Didsbury lines will also be
OL,22,Freduced.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
